msgid "Terms are replaced with placeholders before the request is sent, so the model never sees the term and the translation always uses the wording you specify. This suits brand names, product models, and proper nouns; it does not suit ordinary words, especially in inflected languages such as Russian. Terms only affect future translations; existing translations are not retranslated automatically."
msgstr "术语在送交模型前被替换为占位符，模型看不到该词，译文中该位置固定为你指定的译法。适用于品牌名、产品型号、专有名词；不适用于普通词汇，尤其是俄语等有词形变化的语言。术语只影响之后的翻译，已有译文不会自动重翻。"

