msgstr "正在测试..."

msgid "The admin area is not served over HTTPS, so the API Key will be transmitted in plain text. Enabling HTTPS for the admin area is recommended."
msgstr "当前后台不是 HTTPS，API Key 将以明文经网络传输。建议为后台启用 HTTPS。"

msgid "The config file format_version is %1$s, but this plugin only supports %2$d."
msgstr "配置文件 format_version 为 %1$s，当前插件只支持 %2$d。"

msgid "The entry has been reset to pending and will be retried on the next queue run."
msgstr "该条目已重置为待翻译，将在下次队列执行时重试。"

msgid "The figures below are global counts from the OpenTranslation cache table (all languages combined); they are not the untranslated count of the TranslatePress dictionary tables. See the per-language table below."
msgstr "以下为 OpenTranslation 缓存表的全局统计（所有语言合计），不等于 TranslatePress 字典表的未翻译量。按语言明细见下方表格。"

msgid "The file contains no importable models."
